Hiato — third-party notices
===========================

Word packs
----------
Per-language licenses and attribution ship in each pack JSON
(`public/packs/<lang>/<cefr>.json`) and on the in-app About page.

Portuguese lemmas are curated from Wiktionary-derived / OpenSubtitles
frequency lists (CC-BY-SA-4.0 path, ADR 0009). Gloss and synonym copy is
original to Hiato.

Lemma selection for EN/DE/ES/PT also draws on openly licensed frequency
resources: hermitdave/FrequencyWords (MIT; OpenSubtitles-based) and, where
used, wordhoard POS/CEFR sample banding (dataset CC-BY-SA-4.0 — selection
only; Hiato glosses remain original). Packs are curated learner lists, not
verbatim dumps of any proprietary wordlist (ADR 0026).

